     "content_html": "<p>Binomial formula: For a binomial experiment with <i>n</i> trials and <i>p</i> probability of success in each trial, then P(number of <i>a</i> successes) = <span data-math=\"nCa \\times {p^a} \\times {\\left( {1 - p} \\right)^{n - a}}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>There is one 2 out of 4 sides, so <i>p</i> is <span data-math=\"\\frac{1}{4}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>P(exactly four 2s in 20 rolls) =<span data-math=\"\\left( {30C4} \\right){\\left( {\\frac{1}{4}} \\right)^4}{\\left( {1 - \\frac{1}{4}} \\right)^{30 - 4}}\"></span>.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\left( {27,405} \\right){\\left( {\\frac{1}{4}} \\right)^4}{\\left( {\\frac{3}{4}} \\right)^{26}} \\approx 0.060\"></span></p>\n"
